msgid "Table storage bounds work across unrelated stored records, but a very large gallery or album tree and full source discovery remain limits. A positive page size is recommended on large sites. page_size = 0 keeps the existing show-all behavior; storage reads are internally batched, but the complete response and WordPress, PHP, server or browser output buffering can still use memory proportional to all rows. The plugin will not change the saved page size automatically."
